diff --git a/unreleased_changes/10304.md b/unreleased_changes/10304.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..5c311faf46c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/unreleased_changes/10304.md
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+### Changed
+- All segment-id parameters of the frontend API (e.g. `api.data.labelVoxels`, `api.tracing.setActiveCell` or `api.data.setSegmentColor`) accept plain numbers again, in addition to bigint. Ids above `Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER` still need to be passed as bigint.
